    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t02_01",
      "hash64": "B8FB97ABB6AEDD1D",
      "text": "宝可梦中心特别适合\\n用来和朋友会合。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t02_02",
      "hash64": "B8FB94ABB6AED804",
      "text": "[EMPTY 22]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t02_03",
      "hash64": "B8FB95ABB6AED9B7",
      "text": "咕嘟嘟嘟……\\n啊～喝饱了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t02_04",
      "hash64": "B8FB92ABB6AED49E",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t02_07",
      "hash64": "B8FB91ABB6AED2EB",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t02_08",
      "hash64": "B8FB8EABB6AECDD2",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t02_09",
      "hash64": "B8FB8FABB6AECF85",
      "text": "解麻药寄来了！\\n这个道具能治愈陷入麻痹状态的宝可梦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t02_10",
      "hash64": "B8FEFCABB6B1BE93",
      "text": "对战时首先会派出的，\\n是同行队伍中排在最前面的宝可梦哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t02_11",
      "hash64": "B8FEFBABB6B1BCE0",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t02_12",
      "hash64": "B8FEFEABB6B1C1F9",
      "text": "看你这身制服，是个学生吧。\\c\\n最多能带６只宝可梦同行，\\n所以多带一些在身边准没错。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t02_13",
      "hash64": "B8FEFDABB6B1C046",
      "text": "我呀～在学校里呀～\\n在学习关于宝可梦的知识哦！\\c\\n宝可梦最多\\n能学会４个招式哦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t02_14",
      "hash64": "B8FF00ABB6B1C55F",
      "text": "家在平碟镇的学生不住宿舍，\\n而是每天从家里过来上学！\\r\\n……不过，爬坡道好辛苦啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t02_15",
      "hash64": "B8FEFFABB6B1C3AC",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "t02_17",
      "hash64": "B8FF01ABB6B1C712",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t02_21",
      "hash64": "B8F48BABB6A8AA0B",
      "text": "听说大嘴鸥会把包裹和信件\\n放进嘴巴里来运送哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t02_22",
      "hash64": "B8F48CABB6A8ABBE",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t02_23",
      "hash64": "B8F48DABB6A8AD71",
      "text": "你要去学校吗？\\c\\n记得勤写记录，\\n路上小心哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "t02_24",
      "hash64": "B8F48EABB6A8AF24",
      "text": "这里是平碟镇，\\n可以轻松造访的祥和之镇。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
